---
---

<!-- Facturación -->
<section class="profile__card profile__billing" aria-label="Facturación">
  <h2 class="profile__card-title">Facturación</h2>
  <p class="profile__billing-note">
    Cobros mensuales de tu suscripción Cloud. Acá ves cuándo se pagó cada mes y cuándo
    vence el período actual.
  </p>

  <div class="profile__billing-next" data-billing-next hidden>
    <span class="profile__billing-next-label">Próxima fecha de pago</span>
    <strong data-billing-next-date>—</strong>
  </div>

  <p data-billing-loading class="profile__billing-note">Consultando tus pagos…</p>

  <p data-billing-empty hidden class="profile__billing-note">
    Todavía no hay cobros. Tu primer pago se registrará acá al activar la suscripción.
  </p>

  <table class="profile__billing-table" data-billing-table hidden>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Fecha de pago</th>
        <th>Concepto</th>
        <th class="profile__billing-align-right">Monto</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody data-billing-body></tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="profile__billing-total" data-billing-total hidden>
    Total pagado: <strong data-billing-total-amount>—</strong>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .profile__card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .profile__card-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .profile__billing {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .profile__billing-note {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .profile__billing-next {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .profile__billing-next-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .profile__billing-next strong {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-align: right;
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-table) {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-table th),
  :global(.profile__billing-table td) {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-table th) {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-table td:first-child) {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-align-right) {
    text-align: right;
  }

  :global(.profile__billing-amount) {
    font-weight: 600;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .profile__billing-total {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .profile__billing-total strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .profile__card {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }

    .profile__billing-next {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .profile__billing-total {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }

  /* Facturación: en móvil la tabla se convierte en tarjetas apiladas */
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    :global(.profile__billing-table thead) {
      display: none;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table),
    :global(.profile__billing-table tbody) {
      display: block;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table tr) {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 0.25rem 1rem;
      padding: 0.875rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table td) {
      display: block;
      border-bottom: 0;
      padding: 0;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table td:nth-child(1)) {
      grid-column: 1;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table td:nth-child(2)) {
      grid-column: 1;
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      order: 3;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table td:nth-child(3)) {
      grid-column: 2;
      grid-row: 1 / span 2;
      text-align: right;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    :global(.profile__billing-table td:first-child) {
      white-space: normal;
    }
  }
</style>
